          "prompt": "Complete the equivalent fraction: 2/3 = ?/12.",
          "workedSolution": {
            "steps": [
              "The denominator was multiplied by 4 because 3 x 4 = 12.",
              "Multiply the numerator by the same factor: 2 x 4 = 8.",
              "Therefore, 2/3 = 8/12."
            ],
            "answer": "8"
